# DEMO MODE — use with the "demo" environment only.
# These endpoints return 403 unless the API runs with DEMO_MODE=true.
# See README.md for environments and labels.

### READ ONLY — Health (shows Demo Mode and whether the restore schedule is valid)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### READ ONLY — Status (demoSnapshotReady must be true before restoring)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/management/status
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### DESTRUCTIVE — Capture the demo snapshot (replaces the saved one)
# Set up the showcase family, recipes, and plan first.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/management/demo-capture
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### DESTRUCTIVE — Restore the demo snapshot over the current demo data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/management/demo-restore
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
